- HVG selection robustness. Ensure seurat_v3 with batch_key is actually used; if skmisc/loess is missing, fail fast with a clear install hint rather than silently falling back to seurat (which can degrade HVGs and ARI). Alternatively, fall back to cell_ranger flavor with batch_key if seurat_v3 is unavailable.

- Prioritize prior coverage in gene capping. When enforcing MODEL_GENE_CAP, first guarantee a minimum per-set coverage (e.g., keep all genes needed to maintain ≥5–10 genes per retained set), then fill the remaining budget by interleaving HVGs and genes with high prior_set_counts. The current lexsort can crowd out prior genes when HVGs are plentiful, weakening pathway-aligned latents.

