  - Standardize dataset gene symbols to match prior mapping (uppercase, strip version suffixes), then realign adata.var to prior_genes.csv order; create index arrays for matched genes; drop unmatched.
  - Final gene set for modeling = (HVGs ∪ genes present in any prior set) \ {MT, RPS/RPL}; cap at 7000 by prioritizing HVGs and genes covered by more prior sets; update the membership matrix to the filtered gene order; drop gene sets with size < 5 after intersection.
  - Persist a boolean var['used_in_model'] and save coverage stats.
- Covariates and splits
