[step_0] Current Behavior
- Loads embedding.npy and embedding_metadata.csv; asserts shape/columns; uses metadata split for test-only ARI.
- Builds a cosine k-NN graph via Scanpy’s UMAP connectivities after per-dimension whitening and L2 row-normalization; prunes edges < 0.05; converts to weighted igraph.
- Grid-searches k ∈ {10,15,20,30,40,50} and Leiden resolution ∈ [0.1,1.2] step 0.1:
