- cluster_metrics.json: keys {ari, n_test_used, resolution, k, modularity, stability_global, stability_test}.
- cluster_summary.json: per-cluster dict {size, top_markers, top_gene_sets[{set_id,name,source,size,overlap,pval,qval} or {set_id,name,source,score}], batch_proportions, provisional_label}.
