[step_2] Current Behavior
- Prior-guided masked-decoder VAE with FiLM covariates built from one-hot domain/protocol/dataset; z = [z_prior (pathway/marker), z_free].
- Decoder supports NB or auto-switched ZINB (train zero fraction > 0.6), dataset-specific bias, global logit temperature; W_prior masked by gene-set membership.
- Training: warmup freeze of W_prior, then unfreeze; losses = NB/ZINB NLL + β KL (free-bits) + group L1 on z_prior (size-normalized λ_s, ramped post-unfreeze) + Laplacian on W_prior + decorrelation on z_free (+ optional cross-cov) + MMD on z_free across combined batch groups (dataset|protocol|domain) + L2 on dataset biases + prior identifiability (nonnegativity on W_prior, column-norm ~1, orthogonality W_free⊥W_prior). End-epoch column renorm of W_prior.
- Optimizer: AdamW with param groups (W_free higher WD, W_prior/bias no WD) and LR warmup→cosine; grad clip + AMP. BalancedBatchSampler samples per combined group with replacement.
- Embedding: concatenate mean [z_prior, z_free]; clustering via scanpy neighbors + Leiden on a small grid (k=neighbors_k, cosine; res ∈ {0.4,0.8,1.2}; α reweight for z_prior when concatenated). Selection by silhouette (subsample if large), tie-break by connectivity density; tiny clusters merged to nearest large.
- Artifacts mirrored automatically from step_0 to step_1 and step_2.

Step Change
- Data prep: replaced precomputed obsm covariates with consistent cross-split one-hot domain/protocol/dataset; added combined group_idx for sampler/MMD; prefer X_zscore if present.
- Model/decoder: added ZINB branch (gene-level π), larger numerical clamps, explicit logit_scale.
- Objectives: added/changed
  - Group L1 ramp (post-unfreeze) with size-normalized λ_s.
  - MMD now over combined group_idx (was dataset).
  - Decorrelation only on z_free; optional cross-cov z_prior↔z_free (default off).
  - Prior identifiability: nonnegativity, column-norm, W_free–W_prior orthogonality.
