- cluster_summary.json:
  - Top sets may come from z_prior with explicit column-to-set mapping when available; DEG-based enrichment remains with BH-FDR and corrected background.
- Runtime likely reduced (lighter bootstrap, graph caching), with added robustness to batch effects and ambiguous assignments.
