[Notes]
[curated] Clustering now selects by 0.5*(0.6*sil_test+0.4*sil_global)+0.5*stability−0.1*batch-AMI with an 8–40 cluster gate, uses lighter bootstrap (n_boot=3, sample_frac=0.7), two seeds, fixed cosine; adds optional train-only whitening, numeric/“p10” prune, graph caching, and adopt-if-better train-anchored graphs; supports alpha scaling of z_prior dims ([0.5,1.0,2.0] when n_sets/k_free available); refines via centroid fallback, modularity-gated merges, and optional KMeans=2 split only if modularity and test-silhouette improve; finalizes test-only stability (warn if <0.5), adds ARI test-coverage, more robust DEG ranking, and z_prior name mapping; outputs expand cluster_metrics.json (e.g., neighbor_metric=cosine, prune, alpha_prior_scale, anchored_train_graph) with improved batch mixing, occasional extra subclusters, reduced runtime, and Metric 0.4204504375636808, Gain −0.4021760655296656.
[curated] Builds a canonical gene symbol map; computes batch-robust per-gene variance (library-size normalized log1p, median across batches); loads/canonicalizes priors from MSigDB, GO, human marker table, and NeST; excludes MT/RPS/RPL and unexpressed non-coding genes; filters/deduplicates gene sets (size 5–300, Jaccard>0.8 with temporary removal of ubiquitous genes, adaptively relaxed if <800 sets), ranks by IC=mean(gene variance)*log10(size) to select 800–1500; constructs an IDF-weighted, L2-normalized membership matrix and a NeST-based undirected TF–target adjacency plus normalized Laplacian; computes source-scaled 1/(log2(size)+1) set weights; validates and writes float32 CSR/CSV/JSON prior_* artifacts; step change only expands artifact mirroring (env and step+1..+5, legacy step_0→step_1..5) with no logic changes, so core artifacts are unchanged while additional mirrored copies appear with minor I/O/storage increase; Metric 0.6320416046526136, Gain -0.1905848984407328.
[curated] Added duplicate-symbol collapse with permissive synonym mapping; moved doublet/ambient filtering pre-split and computed detection on all cells; narrowed exclusions to MT/RIBO (IG retained); reserved ≥30% of model genes for non-prior HVGs with prior-first ordering; made HVG batch_key conditional; wrote unscaled prior set weights to PRIOR_DIR with scaled diagnostics separate; added dense, preferred X_zscore and obs.libsize_z; expanded mirroring/metadata (including prior_row_index_for_model_genes); resulting h5ad has counts/X/X_zscore layers, reindexed gene order/checksums and M_final/L_model, potentially more IG and altered gene sets, updated splits/summaries; metric 0.6320416046526136 (gain −0.1905848984407328).
[step_3] Current Behavior
- Prior-guided VAE with masked decoder (W_prior⊙mask + W_free), NB/ZINB likelihood, FiLM on covariates, dataset-specific bias.
- Training: warmups freeze W_prior and W_free, branch-weighted KL (w_prior=1.0, w_free=1.5), z_prior group-L1 with λ_s, Laplacian on W_prior, z_free decorrelation, MMD across datasets on z_free, W_prior nonneg + col-norm, W_free col-norm + orthogonality to W_prior, z_free L2, dataset-bias L2. AMP + grad clip + cosine LR with warmup.
- Balanced batching by dataset for robust MMD; end-epoch column normalization for W_prior and W_free.
- Embeddings = [z_prior|z_free].
- Clustering: train-zscore → PCA(whiten, 64 comps) → KNN(cosine) → Leiden; grid over rep {z_concat, z_prior, z_free}, k {15, 30, 45}, resolution {0.4, 0.8, 1.2, 1.6}, α reweighting of prior (concat path). Select by silhouette; merge tiny clusters; evaluate ARI on test.
- Artifacts: best_model.pt, training_logs.json, model_performance.json, embedding.npy, embedding_metadata.csv, cluster_assignments.csv, cluster_metrics.json, cluster_summary.json, pipeline_summary.json; mirrored to step_1/2/3.

Step Change
- Data/covariates: prefer persisted filtered prior artifacts from preprocess_metadata; accept precomputed obsm["covariates"] (+numeric) or build OHE fallback. Encoder inputs now z-scored via stored train stats; groups for sampler/MMD simplified to dataset only. Removed set-size scaling of λ_s (now λ_s_scaled=λ_s).
- Optimization: separate weight decay for W_free (wfree_weight_decay=5e-3); added warmup to freeze W_free (engage prior branch first). KL now branch-weighted; increased Laplacian (1e-3→3e-3) and orthogonality (1e-4→5e-4); added z_free L2 and W_free col-norm penalties. MMD computed over dataset_idx. End-epoch normalize W_free columns. Expanded training logs.
- Sampler: balance by dataset (randomized order per batch), ensuring multi-dataset composition per batch.
- Clustering: added PCA whitening; broader search over k/resolution/α; α applied pre-PCA for concat; silhouette computed on PCA space; tiny-cluster merge uses PCA space.
- Utilities: mirror_to_steps now includes step_3.

Observed Outputs
- Greater prior utilization early (lower logits_free_frac during warmup), tighter column norms for both branches, reduced batch signal in z_prior; improved batch-invariance in z_free via MMD-by-dataset and stronger W_free regularization.
- More stable clustering (higher silhouette on PCA-whitened space), potentially adjusted n_clusters within [8, 40]; ARI reported on test unchanged interface.
- training_logs.json includes new fields (val_wfree_colnorm, val_zfree_l2, datasets_per_batch_mean); cluster_metrics.json gains selection metadata (rep, k, resolution, α, n_clusters) while retaining "ari".
Metric: 0.6320416046526136, Gain: -0.1905848984407328
[step_3] Current Behavior
- Loads embedding and metadata; builds cell graphs from the latent using multiple methods (UMAP connectivities, SNN Jaccard, mutual kNN) and optional blends.
- Prior-aware preprocessing: optional whitening anchored on train split; optional up/down-weighting of z_prior dimensions via alpha scaling inferred from metadata.
- Broad hyperparameter search over k, resolution, pruning, whitening, graph method, and prior scaling; evaluates full and train-anchored graphs.
- For each candidate: Leiden clustering → refinement (small-cluster modularity merge + SNN/core-based ambiguous-cell reassignment) → optional large-cluster split if it improves test silhouette and modularity.
- Scoring mixes: test/global silhouette (0.6/0.4), batch balance (conditional entropy over dataset/protocol on test), z_prior coherence bonus, microcluster penalty; modularity as tie-break.
- Shortlist stability via bootstrap re-clustering; re-rank by stability; optional consensus across top-3 partitions; final test-only reassignment using train-core neighbors.
- Writes cluster assignments; computes ARI on test (with coverage), test NMI, per-cluster purity; records metrics including graph/param choices and stability; mirrors outputs to step_1.
- Computes DEGs per cluster (Scanpy Wilcoxon with effect-size/percent filters; fallback heuristic if needed).
- Optional post-hoc merge of near-duplicate clusters based on high z_prior mean-vector correlation and DEG overlap, accepted if test silhouette does not degrade; recomputes metrics/DEGs if merged.
- Performs pathway enrichment against priors with BH-FDR and corrected background; if z_prior available, reports top sets from z_prior loadings. Outputs cluster summary with sizes, markers, enriched sets, and batch proportions.

Step Change
- Added: mutual kNN graph, UMAP/SNN blending, train-anchored graph variant, graph caching, igraph conversion from sparse matrices.
- Expanded search space: k in {15, 30, sqrt(n), 50}; resolution 0.2–1.4; prune ∈ {0.0, “p10”, 0.01}; whitening on/off; seeds=3; alpha scaling for z_prior dims {0.5,1,2,4} when n_sets detected.
- Prior-aware features: detect n_sets/k_free from metadata; explicit z_prior scaling; z_prior coherence term in scoring; z_prior-driven duplicate-cluster merge.
- Batch handling: replaced AMI penalty with batch balance via conditional entropy averaged over dataset/protocol on test subset.
- Robustness: bootstrap stability on shortlist; consensus partitioning across top-3; final test-only reassignment restricted to train-core neighbors.
- Refinements: optional split of large clusters gated by improvements in test silhouette and modularity; microcluster penalty in score.
- Metrics/IO: ARI now returns (ari, n_test_used, coverage); added test NMI and coverage to metrics; warning_low_stability only emitted when stability computed; richer metrics payload (graph_method, neighbor_metric, whiten, prune_threshold, alpha_prior_scale, anchored_train_graph, silhouettes, modularity, stabilities, n_clusters).

Observed Outputs
